        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. He Ravguangc zai lou o,",
            "Kandih panti luai mak saan ;",
            "Muang kum na zing mei kandi khou hei",
            "Ata zai lou o.",
            "",
            "Nang rui ram na neila khang mak ge",
            "Lung ti neihla lou nimei",
            "Panti tingmik hei luai guang puthe",
            "Niu ta khuan mak ge.",
            "",
            "2. Kandi apan ti hei,",
            "Lily mun kumc tuai nuang nge;",
            "Ping mei rui padik mei kandih khou,",
            "Ata zailou o.",
            "",
            "3. Zuan dikho gaanhmei thang",
            "Gumeipu phaikam suina;",
            "Zing mei rui muang kum na guang sini",
            "Ping makna tat ni."
          ]
        }
      }
